{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011PmB6vaHdFMTc1EsBxSjxo","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-13-0115-multistream-gkr-input-eval\n2\t\n3\tParallelize the LogUp GKR input evaluation across multiple OS threads with per-thread CUDA streams, using the same multi-stream pattern that achieved 1.89x improvement on Round 0. Nsight profiling shows 791 sequential per-AIR kernel launches (428ms total GPU time) in `log_gkr_input_evals()`, each using only 1-4 SMs on the RTX 4090's 128 SMs. By distributing these independent per-AIR evaluations across 4 threads (each with its own `cudaStreamPerThread`), kernels from different threads can execute concurrently on idle SMs, reducing the GKR input eval wall clock from ~450ms to ~180-220ms and LogUp GKR from 808ms to ~560-630ms.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3001e34b-f3ed-4dd1-9440-8c7993724ff2","uuid":"77a21236-ced1-44e9-b702-967e07ef5917","timestamp":"2026-04-12T23:22:37.525Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-13-0115-multistream-gkr-input-eval\n\nParallelize the LogUp GKR input evaluation across multiple OS threads with per-thread CUDA streams, using the same multi-stream pattern that achieved 1.89x improvement on Round 0. Nsight profiling shows 791 sequential per-AIR kernel launches (428ms total GPU time) in `log_gkr_input_evals()`, each using only 1-4 SMs on the RTX 4090's 128 SMs. By distributing these independent per-AIR evaluations across 4 threads (each with its own `cudaStreamPerThread`), kernels from different threads can execute concurrently on idle SMs, reducing the GKR input eval wall clock from ~450ms to ~180-220ms and LogUp GKR from 808ms to ~560-630ms.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
